---
const platforms = [
  { name: 'Google Ads', logo: '/assets/platforms/google-ads.webp', className: 'icon' },
  { name: 'Meta Ads', logo: '/assets/platforms/meta.svg', className: 'wordmark' },
  { name: 'Taboola', logo: '/assets/platforms/taboola.png', className: 'taboola' },
  { name: 'NewsBreak', logo: '/assets/platforms/newsbreak.svg', className: 'icon' },
  { name: 'TikTok Ads', logo: '/assets/platforms/tiktok.svg', className: 'wordmark' },
  { name: 'MGID', logo: '/assets/platforms/mgid.svg', className: 'wordmark' },
  { name: 'RevContent', logo: '/assets/platforms/revcontent.svg', className: 'wordmark' },
];
---

<section id="plataformas" class="platform-section py-12 border-y border-black/5">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 text-center mb-10">
    <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/50">Fontes de tráfego</p>
    <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-2">Conectado às principais plataformas</h3>
    <p class="text-brand-text/60">Integração nativa para cruzar dados e limpar seu tráfego onde você mais precisa.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="platform-marquee" aria-label="Google Ads, Meta Ads, Taboola, NewsBreak, TikTok Ads, MGID e RevContent">
    <div class="platform-track">
      {Array.from({ length: 4 }, (_, index) => (
        <div class="platform-group" aria-hidden={index > 0 ? 'true' : undefined}>
          {platforms.map((platform) => (
            <div class="platform-card">
              <img src={platform.logo} alt={platform.name} class={platform.className} />
              <span>{platform.name}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-7xl px-4">
    <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-black/5 bg-white p-5">
        <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-dark">Google Ads</p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-text/70">API de Conversões com GCLID preservado em cada clique.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-black/5 bg-white p-5">
        <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-dark">Meta Ads</p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-text/70">Envio duplo browser + CAPI, com deduplicação de evento.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-black/5 bg-white p-5">
        <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-dark">Taboola · NewsBreak · MGID · RevContent</p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-text/70">Do clique no feed até a venda, com o criativo que gerou cada uma.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-black/5 bg-white p-5">
        <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-dark">TikTok Ads</p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-text/70">Eventos de conversão do clique à compra, sem etapa perdida.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-6 text-center text-sm text-brand-text/60">Sete redes, o mesmo padrão de rastreio — é isso que sustenta a garantia de 90%.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .platform-section { background: var(--color-brand-lighter); overflow: hidden; }
  .platform-marquee { overflow: hidden; mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #000 8%, #000 92%, transparent); }
  .platform-track { display: flex; width: max-content; animation: platform-scroll 35s linear infinite; }
  .platform-group { display: flex; gap: 1rem; padding-right: 1rem; flex: none; }
  .platform-card { width: 176px; height: 112px; flex: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .5rem; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, .08); border-radius: 1rem; background: white; }
  .platform-card img { display: block; object-fit: contain; }
  .platform-card img.icon { width: 46px; height: 46px; }
  .platform-card img.wordmark { width: 132px; height: 44px; }
  .platform-card img.taboola { width: 140px; height: 48px; object-fit: cover; }
  .platform-card span { color: var(--color-brand-dark); font-size: .875rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .platform-marquee:hover .platform-track { animation-play-state: paused; }
  @keyframes platform-scroll { to { transform: translateX(-25%); } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .platform-marquee { overflow-x: auto; mask-image: none; }
    .platform-track { animation: none; }
  }
</style>
